# Rimvio Context OS — Five Layers

**Canonical:** `docs/RIMVIO_CANONICAL_VOCABULARY_V2.md` · `docs/RIMVIO_GLOBE_INGRESS.md` · ADR 005 · 009 · 010  
**Wire:** `lib/globe-ingress/` · `lib/context-os/` · `lib/runtime/` · `lib/context-blueprint/` · `lib/operator/`

## Globe Ingress (creation path)

Single unidirectional compiler: **Intent → Context → Bridge → Runtime → Blueprint**

- SSOT: `compileGlobeIngress()` in `lib/globe-ingress/`
- Planner: `planContextRun` → `globe_ingress` (travel trip frame; not lodging/eatery-only)
- Forbidden: Blueprint→Runtime re-entry · Bridge→Intent · Context→Runtime skip

## Article 0

- Reality is never modified without explicit **Commit**
- Intent never mutates Reality
- Blueprint never executes
- Execution never decides
- **Humans own final authority**

## Layer Owner Rule

**Only the owner layer may mutate its own objects.**

| L | Owns |
|---|------|
| L1 | Intent |
| L2 | Context Contract (Blueprint) |
| L3 | Domain Execution |
| L4 | Runtime Reaction |
| L5 | Reality Mutation |

## Forbidden Dependencies

| L | May | Never |
|---|-----|-------|
| **L1** | Call L2 · dispatch L3 (event/interface) | Import L3 impl · domain search · Ghost Pins · booking APIs |
| **L2** | — (pure data) | Import anything · execute |
| **L3** | Read L2 | Mutate L2 · call Globe AI · Commit without approval |
| **L4** | Read L2 · read truth | Create Blueprint · dispatch L3 · mutate L2 |
| **L5** | Read prepared execution | Create execution · decide Intent |

## State machine

`intent → blueprint_created → executing → execution_prepared → waiting_approval → committed → observed → reacted`

Know which state before adding code. See `CONTEXT_RUN_TRANSITIONS`.

## L2 sub-contracts (one SSOT) — Method 2

`ContextBlueprint` v5 = **Intent** + `executionGraph` + `spatialTargets` + `temporalTargets` + **Resources** + **Executors**.

Per node: **Execution → Spatial Target → Resources → Actions**.

**Travel MVP:** `spatialPlan` map projection still OK until derived from `spatialTargets`.

## Vocabulary v2 (1 object = 1 responsibility)

**Globe UX = Reality Surface** — `docs/RIMVIO_REALITY_SURFACE.md`

| Term | OS / Layer | Forbidden on Surface |
|------|-----|-----------|
| **Reality Surface** | Compositor UX | Blueprint · Commit internals |
| **Context** | File content (SSOT) | Runtime/Flow SSOT storage |
| **Bridge** | File identity (graph) | Execution |
| **Runtime** | Process | word **Container** |
| **Blueprint** | Process spec | **globe render** |
| **Flow** | Scheduler state | user "Execution Graph" label |
| **Operator** | user AI | **internals** on globe |
| **Commit** | System call | **globe root** auto-mutate |

IDs: `contextId` · `bridgeId` · `runtimeId` — see `lib/context-os/vocabulary-v2.ts`

