## Container AI (Operator — user sees one AI)

- **Globe AI** = Architect (L1) — Intent · Blueprint · Container **create**
- **Container AI** = Operator — reads Execution Graph every turn · routes internal modules
- User label: **Trip Assistant** — never "Context Condition AI" in UI copy
- Internal modules: Travel Brain · Execution Graph Reader · Context Condition AI · Domain AI Router · Ghost Pins · Action Composer
- Gate: Prepare + "주변 호텔" → block · offer destination chips

See `docs/RIMVIO_CONTAINER_AI.md` · `lib/container-ai/gate-container-ai-request.ts`

**Mantras:** AI recommends · Humans decide · **AI prepares · Humans approve · Reality commits.**

## Execution Space (core OS primitive)

Globe creates **Execution Space** first — NOT "search Osaka".

`resolution`: confirmed | hypothesis | unresolved — **never confirm destination user did not state.**

See `docs/RIMVIO_CONTEXT_OS_ARCHITECTURE.md` § Execution Space.

## PR gate

Owner? Forbidden cross-mutate? Valid state transition? Commit + approvalPolicy?

**Cross-layer = reject.**
